      "id": "bbc-2026-07-02-can-our-fridges-cope-with-heatwaves",
      "title": "Can our fridges cope with heatwaves?",
      "summary": "An expert says many can not handle the high temperatures we have been experiencing.",
      "body": "Up Next. Why Ukrainian strikes on annexed Crimea are a blow to Putin  Video, 00:01:12SubsectionEuropePublished4 hours agoGirl trapped in Venezuela quake 'survived on ketchup and cheese'  Video, 00:01:19SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished2 hours agoEmotion and politics merge in Tehran at funeral of former supreme leader. Video, 00:01:09SubsectionMiddle EastPublished16 hours agoWatch fans react to every goal of England v Mexico game. Video, 00:00:57SubsectionEnglandPublished5 hours agoScorching heat and delays: How Washington DC marked America 250. Video, 00:01:23SectionNewsPublished1 day ago'America's 250th birthday is our 50th  anniversary' Video, 00:01:16SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoBBC in Tehran as mourners gather for former supreme leader's funeral. Video, 00:00:53SubsectionMiddle EastPublished1 day agoCape Verde fans 'proud' despite 3-2 defeat to Argentina. Video, 00:00:52SubsectionAfricaPublished1 day agoWatch: Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce wed in NYC - here's how the day unfolded. Video, 00:01:32SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days ago'It's so hot' - Dangerous hot weather grips parts of the US. Video, 00:01:17SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoMoment huge waterspout twirls over lake in Germany. Video, 00:00:29SubsectionEuropePublished3 days ago",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "business",
      "tags": [],
      "author": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-02T17:46:08.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/branded_news/8ed2/live/02efab20-763d-11f1-a627-714adb4eed6e.jpg",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c8r24vn1r7eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
