      "title": "Show HN: A graph paper generator that renders vector PDFs in the browser",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://freegraphpaper.net/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48761294\nPoints: 65\n# Comments: 15",
      "body": "Free · No login · Instant PDF  Download free printable graph paper as a clean, print-ready PDF — from 5 mm and 1/4 inch grids to 1 cm squares — or make your own custom graph paper in the browser. Beyond classic square grids you'll also find dot grid, isometric, hexagon, lined and Cornell notes paper, every sheet true to scale. Popular graph paper templatesThe grids people print most — one click to a ready PDF.All templates →Make and print your graph paper in 3 steps No sign-up, no watermark, no waiting on a server. Pick a graph paper template or build your own, preview it live, and download a print-ready PDF straight from your browser. 1Pick or customiseStart from a ready-made graph paper template or set your own paper type, spacing, colour and margins.2Preview liveSee an exact, true-to-scale preview update as you change settings — what you see is what prints.3Download & printExport a clean PDF (or PNG), then print at 100% scale for accurate grids every time.Supported graph paper sizes Every graph paper template generates across the full ISO A/B/C series and US/Imperial sizes. US / ImperialUS Letter215.9 × 279.4 mmUS Legal215.9 × 355.6 mmTabloid (Ledger)279.4 × 431.8 mmExecutive184.15 × 266.7 mmJunior Legal127 × 203.2 mmHalf Letter139.7 × 215.9 mmANSI C431.8 × 558.8 mmANSI D558.8 × 863.6 mmANSI E863.6 × 1117.6 mmArch A228.6 × 304.8 mmArch B304.8 × 457.2 mmArch C457.2 × 609.6 mmArch D609.6 × 914.4 mmArch E914.4 × 1219.2 mmISO A SeriesA0841 × 1189 mmA1594 × 841 mmA2420 × 594 mmA3297 × 420 mmA4210 × 297 mmA5148 × 210 mmA6105 × 148 mmA774 × 105 mmA852 × 74 mmA937 × 52 mmA1026 × 37 mmISO B SeriesB01000 × 1414 mmB1707 × 1000 mmB2500 × 707 mmB3353 × 500 mmB4250 × 353 mmB5176 × 250 mmB6125 × 176 mmB788 × 125 mmB862 × 88 mmB944 × 62 mmB1031 × 44 mmISO C SeriesC0917 × 1297 mmC1648 × 917 mmC2458 × 648 mmC3324 × 458 mmC4229 × 324 mmC5162 × 229 mmC6114 × 162 mmC781 × 114 mmC857 × 81 mmC940 × 57 mmC1028 × 40 mmGraph paper: questions & answersWhat is graph paper? Graph paper — also called grid paper or squared paper — is paper printed with an even grid of squares that helps you draw to scale, plot data and keep work neat. FreeGraphPaper turns any grid into a clean, print-ready PDF.Is the printable graph paper free? Yes. Every graph paper PDF here is completely free — no login, no sign-up and no watermark. Download as many sheets as you like.How do I print graph paper at the right size? Download the PDF and print at 100% scale (turn off “fit to page”) so a 5 mm or 1/4 inch grid measures exactly right on paper.What graph paper sizes and spacings can I download? Popular options include 5 mm, 1 cm, 1/8 inch and 1/4 inch graph paper on A4, US Letter and the full ISO A/B/C range — plus dot grid, isometric, hexagon and lined paper.",
