      "id": "hackernews-2026-07-01-weave-robotics-launches-isaac-1-a-7-999-home-robot-with-fall",
      "title": "Weave Robotics launches Isaac 1, a $7,999 home robot with Fall 2026 deliveries",
      "summary": "https://runtimewire.com/article/weave-robotics-isaac-1-home-...\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48750989\nPoints: 209\n# Comments: 302",
      "body": "Our mobile robot designed from the ground up for the home.It's made to feel natural in your space and handle tedious tasks so that you don't have to.Laundry FlowLaundry, more optional by the day.With Laundry Flow, Isaac 1  goes beyond folding, finding and picking up dirty clothes and handling loaded hampers.Daily ResetYour spaces, tidied.Isaac 1 resets the rooms in your home so that every day you come back to spaces that are ready to be lived in.Beds, made.  Pillows, blankets, kids' and pets' toys, shoes, back where they belong.Made to fit in every home, including yours.SageA holistic approach to a first of its kind.Robots for the home require a full-stack approach, so we built Isaac 1 from the ground up in San Francisco.To get it right, we designed and built our own actuators, remote actuation system, and safety systems.Made for our spaces.Isaac's solid inner structure gives it form.  Around it, soft fabric shells give Isaac 1 a familiar feel in the home.The shells provide passive safety and can be swapped or removed to fit the character of your home.Its collapsible torso means it can extend to a human height when needed, or collapse down when it's not working.That way, when it's not working, it can be out of sight and out of mind.Design you can trust.Privacy is core to Isaac 1's design, with physical cues that inherently make clear when Isaac 1 is working, and when it’s not.Its wheeled base means Isaac 1 is passively stable as it completes tasks in your home.Capable from day one.Isaac 1 completes tasks and navigates your home autonomously by default, with teleoperation assistance when needed to guarantee we complete tasks.Works only when you want it to.Isaac 1 works only when you want it to, on-demand or at a scheduled time, via our companion app.  Whether you're at home or away.Constantly improving.Isaac 1 will only get better over time, both as you use it and as we update it with new capabilities.Product specsPowerBattery life8 hoursCharge time2 hoursDimensionsFootprint20.5\" × 22\" (W × D)Height3' – 5'9\" Vertical reach80\"Horizontal reach33\"Degrees of freedomNeck2Arms2 × 6Hands2 × 1Torso2Base3Frequently asked questionsBring Isaac 1 home.Pre-order Isaac 1",
